WEBVTT

00:00:29.994 --> 00:00:33.053
one iste olovne čizme, opet,

00:00:33.053 --> 00:00:36.070
prostor tada stade da zvoni,

00:00:36.070 --> 00:00:38.210
k'o da su sva nebesa zvono,

00:00:38.210 --> 00:00:40.201
a biće samo da je uho,

00:00:40.201 --> 00:00:43.284
i ja, i tišina, čudno pleme

00:00:43.284 --> 00:00:46.493
ovdje, brodolomno i samo.

00:00:46.493 --> 00:00:49.670
Tada baš u razumu puče daska

00:00:49.670 --> 00:00:53.011
i padala sam niže, niže,

00:00:53.011 --> 00:00:55.686
po jedan svijet otkrih svakim uronom

00:00:55.686 --> 00:01:00.198
– i kraj znanja stiže".